OL,3,GNEWSACyclist, 78, dies weeks after
OL,4,Acrash with car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 78-year-old cyclist has died weeks
OL,7,Fafter being seriously injured in a
OL,8,Fcrash with a car, police have
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,12,FA1156 Felixstowe Road, near Trinity
OL,13,FPark, in Ipswich, just after 17:15 BST
OL,14,Fon 6 October.
OL,16,FSuffolk Police said a man suffered
OL,17,F"potentially life-threatening injuries"
OL,18,Fafter a crash between a black Hyundai
OL,19,FTucson and a bicycle.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
