OL,3,GNEWSACyclist, 78, dies weeks after
OL,4,Acrash with car
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was airlifted to Addenbrooke's
OL,7,FHospital, in Cambridge, before being
OL,8,Fpronounced dead as a result of his
OL,9,Finjuries on 29 October.
